/E (Huntsman Cancer Institute broke ground on the campus last year. Since then, significant work has taken place behind the scenes and below the surface, including planning, excavation, groundwater removal, and the installation of 830 deep foundation supports. With that work complete, vertical construction is now beginning.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
