/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 409 0 R
/E (If residents have subsidized access to a larger library in Orem, there is naturally less demand and less incentive to expand the service here at home. At the same time, we are directing public resources and Vineyard tax dollars toward an outside option instead of building momentum around our own library. Vineyard tax dollars should stay in Vineyard.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
536 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 409 0 R
