/E (I have asked staff to start exploring transitional options for a larger library. That could include leasing affordable vacant commercial space, working with Utah City or another partner on subsidized space, using a temporary modular facility, or finding another creative and cost-effective solution that gives us room to expand the physical collection and programming while we work toward a permanent home. The budget freed up by ending that reimbursement directly supports this.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [15]
