/P 411 0 R
/T (Vineyard City is making meaningful progress in addressing illegal short-term rentals. More than 20 have been shut down over the past three months, including three in one recent week. The City is also working directly with Vrbo to remove listings that do not comply with City requirements. Education remains an important part of this effort, and many property owners have voluntarily removed their listings after learning about the regulations.)
