/E (On August 6, Vineyard families gathered at Vineyard Grove Park for one final afternoon of summer fun before heading back to school. The event gave children a chance to cool off, spend time with friends, and enjoy the last days of summer vacation together.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
616 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 415 0 R
/E (The park was filled with activities for the entire family, including a 32-foot slip and slide, 1,000 water balloons, water games, music, and free ice cream. There were plenty of ways for everyone to get involved, have fun, and stay cool throughout the afternoon.)
