/Title (In addition to formal enforcement, we have noticed an increase in property owners voluntarily removing their listings after learning that short-term rentals are not permitted in Vineyard. Education remains an important part of our approach. Our goal is to educate property owners, answer questions, and help them come into compliance whenever possible.)
