/Title (Accessory dwelling units, commonly referred to as ADUs or basement apartments, must be properly registered with Vineyard City. Under current City requirements, an ADU is permitted only when the property is also occupied by the owner. Registration helps the City verify that applicable health, safety, parking, and occupancy requirements are being met.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3261 0 R
/Prev 3391 0 R
/Next 3356 0 R
>>
