<<
/Title (Short-term rentals, including those advertised through Airbnb, Vrbo, and other vacation-rental platforms, are not permitted within Vineyard City. This includes renting an entire home, basement apartment, or individual room for short-term stays.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3361 0 R
/Prev 3394 0 R
/Next 3405 0 R
>>
endobj
3405 0 obj
<<
/Title (Vineyard City is making meaningful progress in addressing illegal short-term rentals. More than 20 have been shut down over the past three months, including three in one recent week. The City is also working directly with Vrbo to remove listings that do not comply with City requirements. Education remains an important part of this effort, and many property owners have voluntarily removed their listings after learning about the regulations.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3361 0 R
/Prev 3404 0 R
/Next 3395 0 R
>>
endobj
3406 0 obj
<<
/Title (Looking for information about parking, pets, property maintenance, building requirements, zoning, or other City regulations? Vineyard City's complete Municipal Code is available online 24/7 for residents, businesses, and property owners. The code library also includes ordinances, resolutions, zoning regulations, the General Plan, subdivision code, and other important City documents, making it easy to find the information you need anytime.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3396 0 R
/Next 3407 0 R
>>
endobj
